window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"ksante","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Locke","Locke","Locke","Locke","Locke"],"spikes":[{"when":"Every trade, levels 1-5","text":"His whole kit taxes your HP bar in percentages — nothing you build out-grows it, so minimise trades instead of trying to out-tank them."},{"when":"His 6 + first item","text":"Purgatory executes through effective HP and grounds your dashes — All Out's stripped resists make it worse."},{"when":"Teamfights","text":"Your value is peel and displacement for your team — the 1v1 itself never becomes winnable."},{"text":"Ashen Pursuit is a flat 10s and his only exit — the ten seconds after he spends it is the entire window you get to step up and commit in.","when":"E on cooldown"}],"wants":{"you":["Farm safe and concede the duel","Save W stun for his dash","Peel teammates instead of dueling"],"foe":["Tax your HP bar every trade","Execute you through All Out","Make your tank items worthless"]},"early":"Call it what it is: a counter-pick. Soul Nails marks tax you from 950 range while your level-1 damage is nil, and Soul Ignition's true damage refunds straight back to him, eroding you faster than you sustain. Trade as little as possible, hold W for his Ashen Pursuit dash-in, and treat safe CS under tower as success.","mid":"It gets no better at 6 — Purgatory executes through effective HP AND grounds you, so the All Out dash meant to reach him simply stops. Never transform just to duel him. Use Q and W to survive his engages, keep the wave close to your tower, and pull jungle pressure toward this lane.","late":"His percent-execute scaling means HP stacking never buys you the escape — the duel is unwinnable at every item count. Redefine your job: peel your carries, use W and E to block his dive, and use All Out to shove HIM out of the fight and into your team rather than trying to kill him yourself.","whys":["Soul Nails marks punish your huge HP bar from 950 range while your level-1 damage is nil.","His marks keep out-trading you — your early all-in is too weak to answer back.","Soul Ignition's true damage refunds to him, eroding you faster than you sustain.","Through 4-5 he out-DPSes your tankiness and dodges the pull with Ashen Pursuit (10s).","Purgatory executes through effective HP and grounds the dash All Out relies on to reach him.","His AP spike plus missing-HP on-hit beats your bruiser first item.","His execute scales with every seal, so HP stacking never lifts you above his floor late."]});
